Actual purpose: Add type-safe delegate helper API for ScreenCaptureKit

This commit adds:
1. SCStreamOutputHandler interface for type-safe delegate callbacks
2. NewSCStreamOutputDelegate() helper function
3. NewSimpleSCStreamOutputDelegate() for function-based delegates
4. screencapture-delegate-demo example showing the API
5. Documentation in CLAUDE.md and example README

Benefits:
- Type-safe parameters (SCStream instead of objc.ID)
- No manual selector name construction
- Eliminates class registration boilerplate
- More idiomatic Go code
- Fully backward compatible with objc.RegisterClass

